description=Craft a Shop Catalogue from a Notebook and use it to buy and sell items for cash. Every vanilla item is priced individually; items added by other mods are priced by the same rules and can be filtered by source mod. NOTE: with many item mods installed, the first time you open the Buy window in a session takes a few seconds while every modded item is priced. It is instant afterwards. Buying deducts real Money and MoneyBundles; selling pays 90 percent of value, scaled by condition, and never destroys what it will not pay for.
